    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>新年第一更，意思是迎来了一位来自美丽新疆的新嘉宾：鸡腿饭！作为刘菠萝的健身教练，鸡腿饭鼓动了一年之后，刘菠萝终于在今年的过年假期迎来了新疆之旅！新疆遍地都是迪丽热巴？赛里木湖不去真的白活？新疆的高速随随便便开一百八？刘菠萝一辈子没见过的这么厚的雪？大盘鸡还是别人的好吃？雪地里骑马有多爽？雪山看多了也就那样？八小时车程刘菠萝彻底疯狂了？意思是去了新疆不白活，苍白的语言很难形容出那么美丽的景色，所以评论区有惊喜！</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lhwp5Ag8X2Zn6aKNa-7HbxKsuxd0.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><strong><span>赛里木湖的大马</span></strong></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lgs9eJQ6KWnDYLGWiMx7OZ3Zr6aN.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><strong><span>没见过冰湖的乡里别</span></strong></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FlFeBo-EKNH9cPTyD4_SP0okXxca.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><strong><span>谁能拒绝小鸭子呢</span></strong></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lsnKQCULzoZ8bUwPtXrLUQTeeHn2.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><strong><span>墨绿冰泡</span></strong></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FgxR0UF5CLFGiM0KfiCwi6DG9rf2.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><strong><span>滑冰大队</span></strong></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FgXmtcxCXpz_3gOuZYa__aDNGF1d.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><strong><span>灯塔霹雳舞王</span></strong></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FuWL1zMvxO5EZOv_f7UYVvcYOpX9.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><strong><span>人群上的假玫瑰</span></strong></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqF8r_BHEfQRyLEpQhjoVpjvxFks.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><strong><span>蓝调时刻！！</span></strong></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtjKfhLTew7CEvT61yBwNxEKYgCM.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><strong><span>谁能拒绝粉色的雪山呢</span></strong></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FhQp7MCsyrhfPUAiNBNScfVOay1s.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><strong><span>果子沟大桥欢迎您</span></strong></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/loCvxYfu9-YN8w7ZA2fz-kqWq6o6.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><strong><span>这真不知道什么树 没见过拍一下</span></strong></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fucu9_ObU4rqXj3bHJMFi8W7hOIt.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><strong><span>狼哥潇洒的背影</span></strong></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fv7lHUSlclA8aKGdlQDzs0jKdCPM.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><strong><span>谁敢说不美！</span></strong></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fkxt9Bg3Df5H1Kd3brTh73cRGqQN.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><strong><span>浪漫骑马</span></strong></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FnXVFUBO0qpCZnf2V0xjnRVS47Nr.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><strong><span>马哥不肯掉头</span></strong></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lqkIzWZTRP7zsNLAxo9pb1B5tndE.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><strong><span>羊咩咩</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>更多精彩请看评论区！</span></p>]]></description>
